1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:00,460
M: Hello.

2
00:00:00,890 --> 00:00:01,840
My name is Eric Farmer.

3
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:06,065
I received a bill in the mail today, but that shouldn't have happened.

4
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:11,720
I signed up for the automatic payment system two months ago, so the bill should have already been paid.

5
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,260
W: Let me check on that, Mr. Farmer.

6
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:15,680
May I have your address, please?

7
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:19,220
M: I live at 382 Washington Avenue.

8
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:27,540
W: Hmm...According to the computer, the money was withdrawn from your account yesterday, so you were sent the bill in error.

9
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,440
M: I can disregard it, right?

10
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:30,480
W: That's correct.

11
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,760
And thanks for bringing this to our attention.

12
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:36,900
We'll check the computer system for other problems like this.
